                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7327b4b7-0eb9-4a62-b76a-822bba0ee803",
                                "sense_id": "4734016d-dd84-3af7-8ab5-51752306de00",
                                "text": "Э́той остроу́мной систе́ме (прия́тно дока́зывавшей не́кий чи́сто неме́цкий поро́к в планиро́вке трамва́йных ли́ний) Фёдор Константи́нович сле́довал охо́тно, одна́ко, по рассе́янности, по неспосо́бности дли́тельно ласка́ть мы́слью вы́году, и ду́мая уже́ о друго́м, машина́льно плати́л на́ново за биле́т, кото́рый намерева́лся сэконо́мить.",
                                "translation": "This clever system (pleasant evidence of a certain purely German flaw in the planning of tram routes) was willingly followed by Fyodor; from absentmindedness however, from an incapacity to cherish a material advantage for any length of time, and already thinking of something else, he paid automatically for the new ticket he had intended to save on.",
                                "english": "This clever system (pleasant evidence of a certain purely German flaw in the planning of tram routes) was willingly followed by Fyodor; from absentmindedness however, from an incapacity to cherish a material advantage for any length of time, and already thinking of something else, he paid automatically for the new ticket he had intended to save on."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
